flowchart TD
    box_0(["Start"])
    box_1{"Input material quality of parts OK?"}
    box_2["Complete the following checks: 1. Check whether<br/>different part types are mixed on the supply<br/>conveyor. 2. Check parts for material deformation,<br/>stains, damage, or injection molding defects."]
    box_3["Empty the supply conveyor(s), fill with the correct<br/>part type, create a non conformance record, and load<br/>a new batch."]
    box_4{"Positional deviation OK?"}
    box_5["Check the positional deviation by means of the<br/>positional deviation meter"]
    box_6["Adjust the positional deviation, if outside the<br/>specifications, create a non conformance record."]
    box_7{"Part height OK?"}
    box_8["Check the insertion depth by means of the depth<br/>gauge"]
    box_9["Have the line operator adjust the part height, if<br/>outside the specifications, create a non conformance<br/>record."]
    box_10{"Correct marking pattern?"}
    box_11["Check whether the correct program is loaded on the<br/>operator control interface and compare it with the<br/>marking controller."]
    box_12["Switch the machine to the correct product and<br/>restart the marking controller."]
    box_13{"Color / brightness of the marking unit text OK?"}
    box_14["Complete the following checks: 1. Verify that the<br/>parts are within specification norms. 2. Check the<br/>process fluid level of the marking unit."]
    box_15["If parts are outside norm, create a non conformance<br/>record. Then complete the following steps: 1. Clean<br/>the fume extraction unit (fume extraction cleaning<br/>procedure). 2. Have the line operator top up the<br/>marking unit with process fluid. 3. Have the line<br/>operator clean the filtration unit (filtration unit<br/>cleaning procedure)."]
    box_16{"Problem solved?"}
    box_17["Escalate to the maintenance team: the marking<br/>problem could not be resolved through operator level<br/>troubleshooting."]
    box_18(["End"])

    box_0 --> box_1
    box_2 --> box_1
    box_1 -->|"No"| box_3
    box_1 -->|"Yes"| box_4
